<title>JAPAN: Japan to offer Treasury bills on Monday -- MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan to offer Treasury bills on Monday -- MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) is planning to offer Treasury bills on Monday through a price-competitive auction, a MOF official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The offer is likely to be 1.3 trillion yen worth of three-month T-bills, bond traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
